			"Message": "chore(build): add initial .gitignore file\n\nAdds an empty .gitignore file to establish standard repository configuration patterns for the Land project. While currently empty, this file will serve as a centralized location to:\n- Exclude build artifacts (e.g., Tauri target directories, Node modules)\n- Ignore editor/IDE temporary files\n- Prevent accidental commits of environment-specific configs\n\nThis foundational setup aligns with Land's cross-platform architecture needs and establishes hygiene patterns critical for maintaining a clean workspace as development scales across Rust (Mountain), TypeScript (Sky/Cocoon), and multiple build systems.",
			"SHA": "a0b82539ab8825cbb21156193fa30fb079d3c5de"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-05-29T17:20:57Z",
