				"⣿⠃⠀⠀⠀",
				23,
				6
			],
			"Message": "refactor(build): Replace binary module with structured build system\n\n- Remove legacy `Source/Binary` module in favor of new `Build` system under `Source/Build.rs`\n- Implement comprehensive build configuration management with logging (using `env_logger` and `colored`)\n- Add enhanced error handling with detailed error variants and `thiserror`\n- Introduce atomic file operations with `Guard` system for safe Cargo.toml/tauri.conf modifications\n- Improve CLI argument parsing with environment variable support for build parameters\n- Add semantic version/bundle ID generation with PascalCase conversion utilities\n- Configure optimized release builds in new `.cargo/config.toml` (LTO, strip symbols)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Removes previous binary module - all build commands must now use new `Build` entrypoint\nRefs #123",
			"SHA": "3d73508e7d10c7026542523d2a69b9f9c669e03b"
		},
